list of military terms if you wanted to be the best general in history
=======================================================================

If you wanted to be remembered as the greatest general in history, you'd need a vocabulary built around strategy, deception, discipline, logistics, intelligence, and the psychology of warfare.

Think Alexander the Great, Hannibal, Julius Caesar, Napoleon, and Sun Tzu. The best commanders didn't just win battles — they shaped the conditions that made victory possible.

